# Build-context exclusions for `docker build -f frontend/sandbox/Dockerfile .`
#
# Docker prefers this file over the context-root `.dockerignore`, which
# excludes `frontend/` for the backend image. The sandbox image needs only
# the three static files its Dockerfile copies.

*
!frontend/sandbox/index.html
!frontend/sandbox/runtime.js
!frontend/sandbox/nginx.conf
